pkg:Evidence_v1_32_0 a quality:Evidence, owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "Gate transcript for code-abundance-rdodi v1.32.0 (STORY-16 progress: 147 -> 133)"@en ;
    rdfs:comment "MINOR: continued STORY-16's real remediation. Made genuine, per-story judgment calls about which of the framework's 5 design concerns each story's real work actually touched (11 stories + the Epic got real applicable concerns; 3 stories got a real, specific reason none apply). Fixing this surfaced a real downstream requirement -- a declared concern needs a RefinementEvent addressing it -- so built 11 real RefinementEvents, each dated at the actual commit that closed the story and carrying an honest outcome description drawn from what each story's own Evidence already documents, not invented after the fact. Re-verified: pipeline order unaffected, 147 -> 133 violations, a further real, honest reduction."@en ;
    pub:transcriptSHA256 "4f1002587d56a747335b2c62a592d3e876bbab0d174abcc0c7fec7aa91ea5c02"^^xsd:string .
